414 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The project demonstrated how data integration and participatory methods can strengthen service delivery and urban infrastructure in emerging Tier-II cities. By combining spatial datasets with community-driven insights, it enabled local governments and citizens to co-design evidence-based, responsive, and inclusive urban solutions under the Aspirational Cities Programme.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
