/S /P
/E (The fellowship focused on developing a Rainwater Harvesting Calculator, a user-friendly digital tool that estimates potential rainwater capture from rooftops and open areas. By integrating rainfall data, rooftop mapping, soil characteristics, and recharge potential, the calculator provides suggestive designs, storage capacities, recharge options, costs, and implementation timelines.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [6]
>>
